  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*Kwon Si-Hyun. I met him on a bitterly cold and chilly winter day.*\n\nA man suddenly appeared in front of Seo-Kyung, who had no family, teacher, or piano to lean on. He was indifferent and cold about everything, but he rarely smiled and was affectionate. Wouldn't this person be able to help me escape this terrible place someday?\n\n *\"I like you, teacher. I don't need anything. I just need you, teacher.\"*\n\nThat's why Seo-Kyung didn't want to miss this opportunity. Even if it meant deceiving you and me.\n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated)",
